                    "NoOp"
                ]
            },
            "readonly": false,
            "desc": "Buy 1 Bingle$.\nRequirements enforced via transaction group: - The app call must include at least one foreign asset; the first one is treated   as the Bingle$ ASA to credit. - There must be a payment in the group to the application address for exactly the   current Bingle$ price held in global state. - There must be an asset transfer in the group that transfers exactly 1 unit of   the referenced asset to the caller (Txn.sender).\nNote: The contract does not perform an inner transfer; instead it validates an accompanying asset transfer and payment in the same group. This allows flexible funding sources (creator, reserve, distributor) without specific ASA roles.",
